--[[
        UNIVERSAL CUSTOM ASSETS -- an animator for DOORS' things and your own

        Every setting, with its default. All optional, before the loadstring:

            _G.UniversalAssets = {
                Combo = { "U", "I", "O" },  -- hold Ctrl and type these: opens / closes the panel
                ComboTime = 2,              -- seconds allowed between those keys
                PlayKey = "P",              -- Ctrl + P: play / stop, also with the panel closed
                FreeCamKey = "F",           -- Ctrl + F: free camera on / off
                UIScale = 1.2,              -- size of the panel
                MoveSnap = 0.5,             -- studs   (0 = free)
                RotateSnap = 15,            -- degrees (0 = free)
                ScaleSnap = 0.05,           --         (0 = free)
                FreeCamSpeed = 24,          -- studs per second; Shift = a quarter
                LookSpeed = 0.25,           -- degrees per pixel, right mouse in the free camera
                OpenTime = 0.6,             -- seconds to open / close doors and drawers
                Folder = "UniversalAssets", -- where projects are saved
            }
            loadstring(game:HttpGet("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bonellocristian78-lab/Gradish-Mode/main/UniversalAssets"))()

        LIKE ROBLOX STUDIO
            Ctrl+1 select, Ctrl+2 move (arrows), Ctrl+3 scale, Ctrl+4 rotate (rings)
            click a model to select it; hold the right mouse button to look around
            Free cam: WASD, E up, Q down, Shift slow, wheel forward, right mouse to look

        KEYS
            Two keys = the model goes from one to the other in that time, with that
            easing (Smooth = a curve through all the keys). A key can also start an
            animation (kept going if the next key asks for the same one), a sound and
            an action: open / close (doors, drawers: anything on a hinge or a rail),
            lights off / on / flicker, hide / show.

        ANIMATIONS NOT OWNED BY THIS GAME
            Roblox plays an animation only in games owned by whoever uploaded it (in
            DOORS: LSPLASH). Any other one is converted on insert: its KeyframeSequence
            is downloaded and played by this script, joint by joint. Nothing is uploaded.
            Everything is local: only you see it.
]]

